may request a donation or be shareware.


To install:

	Copy TopUpdate and TopUsers! to pfiles:
	
	Make a directory pfiles:TopUsers
	
	Setup Topupdate to be run regularly to create/update the data using
	a BBSEVENT etc...

	Add pfiles:TopUsers to your pfiles area or to the main menu as a C
	pfile.

	Log on and use the RUN command to run pfiles:TopUpdate the first time
	to create the initial data files.

Notes:

	TopUpdate will load and sort all of your users and save them 
according to the 4 criteria. (Calls, Public Posts, Megs Uploaded, Megs
Downloaded) It is pretty quick -- It takes under 30 seconds to load, and sort
my userlog of 190 users 4 times.

Possible Future Enhancements:

	- More/Configurable Stats
	- The ability to exclude certain users from certain tests. (Right now
 	  the sysop ONLY is excluded from all categories)
	- Nicer display, maybe bar graphs or something to that effect.

